<h2>Complete Usage Example</h2>

<pre><code>import pandas as pd
from accelerometer_analysis import load_accelerometer_data, AccelerometerRegionDetector, visualize_results

# Load data
df = load_accelerometer_data('gait_data.csv')

# Create detector
detector = AccelerometerRegionDetector(df)

# Method 1: K-Means with 4 clusters
labels_kmeans, features = detector.kmeans_segmentation(n_clusters=4, window_size=50)

# Method 2: PCA anomaly detection
labels_pca, errors = detector.pca_anomaly_detection(window_size=50, n_components=3, threshold=2.0)

# Visualize K-Means results
fig = visualize_results(df, labels_kmeans, "K-Means (4 clusters)")
plt.savefig('kmeans_results.png')

# Visualize PCA results
fig = visualize_results(df, labels_pca, "PCA Anomaly Detection")
plt.savefig('pca_results.png')</code></pre>

