<p>Converts window-based labels back to original time series length.</p>

<hr>

<h2>Summary</h2>

<p>This implementation provides two complementary approaches:</p>

<ol>
  <li><strong>K-Means with 4 clusters</strong> - For identifying distinct gait phases</li>
  <li><strong>PCA anomaly detection</strong> - For finding unusual patterns</li>
</ol>

<p>Both methods:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Use sliding window feature extraction</li>
  <li>Standardize features before processing</li>
  <li>Work with 3-axis accelerometer data (ax, ay, az)</li>
  <li>Include visualization functions</li>
</ul>

<p>The code is designed for gait analysis but works with any accelerometer time series data.</p>

